---
import { SITE_NAME } from '../data/site';
import Section from './Section.astro';

const options = [
	{ n: '01', name: 'Stainless whistling kettle', price: '$39.99', on: true },
	{ n: '02', name: 'Enamel stovetop kettle', price: '$36.50', on: false },
	{ n: '03', name: 'Glass electric kettle', price: '$38.00', on: false },
];
---

<Section id="conversation" layout="center" title="Say what you need.">
	<Fragment slot="intro">
		{SITE_NAME} finds the product, reads out the options and asks for the exact amount before anything is paid. Replies are read
		by your screen reader or by {SITE_NAME} itself, so you don’t need one. Track and return from the same chat.
	</Fragment>
	<figure aria-label="Example conversation" class="overflow-hidden rounded-(--radius-panel) border border-edge bg-surface-1 text-left">
		<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line px-6 py-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">
			<span>New chat</span>
			<span>Demo</span>
		</div>
		<div class="space-y-8 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8">
			<div>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">You</p>
				<p class="text-xl">Kettle, under forty dollars.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">{SITE_NAME}</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-ink-muted">Three options, with shipping included.</p>
				<ol class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
					{
						options.map((o) => (
							<li
								class:list={[
									'grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-3 py-3.5',
									o.on ? 'text-ink' : 'text-ink-muted',
								]}
							>
								<span class="data text-sm text-accent">{o.n}</span>
								<span class="text-lg">{o.name}</span>
								<span class="data text-base">{o.price}</span>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ol>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">You</p>
				<p class="text-xl">The first one.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">{SITE_NAME}</p>
				<div class="border-t-2 border-accent pt-5">
					<p class="text-lg font-bold">Ready to pay</p>
					<dl class="data mt-3 space-y-1 text-base">
						<div class="flex justify-between"><dt class="text-ink-muted">Item</dt><dd>$34.99</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between"><dt class="text-ink-muted">Shipping</dt><dd>$5.00</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between border-t border-line pt-2 text-lg"><dt>Total</dt><dd>$39.99</dd></div>
					</dl>
					<div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-base font-bold text-accent-ink">Pay $39.99 to KettleCo</span>
						<span class="px-3 py-3 text-base text-ink-muted">Cancel</span>
					</div>
					<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">Or say “pay thirty-nine ninety-nine”.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</figure>
</Section>
